  "selected_clauses": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 6.1,
      "end": 9.04,
      "text": "这件马甲的话是羊毛的,",
      "members": [
        1
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 23.92,
      "end": 27.6,
      "text": "所以你秋冬穿的话,它是很软和,但是有弹力的,上身舒适度非常的高。",
      "members": [
        5
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 28.22,
      "end": 31.9,
      "text": "它是带有弹力的,就像毛芝一样,但它的克重也是比较高的这一件。",
      "members": [
        6
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 190,
      "start": 466.13,
      "end": 468.23,
      "text": "但我身上这一件,它就是长毛颗粒感的",
      "members": [
        190
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 706.36,
      "end": 708.18,
      "text": "哎哟的天呐这马甲版型真的太好了",
      "members": [
        282
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 712.87,
      "end": 715.61,
      "text": "咋这么显个高呢因为这个马甲它版型短",
      "members": [
        286,
        287
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 717.53,
      "end": 719.67,
      "text": "马甲卡拉里面拍大就行这玩意就宽松的",
      "members": [
        289,
        290
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 760.42,
      "end": 766.78,
      "text": "你要想看像我一样穿的肥一点宽松一点的你就买S了但是你买你正常体重的大一码就可以了",
      "members": [
        312,
        313,
        314
